      <title>OpenAI首席科学家回应Astra模型不可监控争议</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/gpt/post/20260903/OpenAI%E9%A6%96%E5%B8%AD%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E5%AE%B6%E5%9B%9E%E5%BA%94Astra%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E7%9B%91%E6%8E%A7%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE/</link>
